OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Cyril Scott
OL,6,     F5/5. Donald Macleod follows Cyril
OL,7,     FScott through the final decades of
OL,8,     Fhis life, including his turbulent
OL,9,     Frelationship with the BBC.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FThe London Bulgarian Choir live in
OL,12,     Fstudio. Curator Ann Dumas on
OL,13,     FPainting The French Riviera, a new
OL,14,     Fexhibition about to open at the
OL,15,     FRoyal Academy of Arts.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,19,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,20,     FElgar, Bernstein and Handel.
