OL,3,V}yyy5CFriday
OL,5,G2200 Late Junction
OL,6,     FNew York bassoonist Rebekah Heller
OL,7,     Fhas crafted a mixtape for her
OL,8,     Fneighbour, Steve Reich, to
OL,9,     Fcelebrate the minimalist
OL,10,     Fcomposer's 90th birthday. Verity
OL,11,     FSharp shares the music.
OL,12,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,13,     FTonight, Soweto is in conversation
OL,14,     Fwith American saxophone colossus
OL,15,     FGary Bartz. They discuss
OL,16,     Feverything from his early
OL,17,     Finfluences, to working with Miles
OL,18,     Fand Max Roach, and more.
